(6874447, 1035209, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>The only creative shot in the challenge. Don''t know how you got the awesome light trails in basic (they look too perfect), so hopefully it doesn''t get DQ''ed.</td>', '#1The only creative shot in the challenge. Don''t know how you got the awesome light trails in basic (they look too perfect), so hopefully it doesn''t get DQ''ed.', '2012-10-03 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6874448, 1035249, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2<br/>I expected a shots like this, but more than one. As the solo entry with this idea, and well executed, it deserves this spot. The faucet is little too large and kind of distracting, but it''s still a good entry.</td>', '#2I expected a shots like this, but more than one. As the solo entry with this idea, and well executed, it deserves this spot. The faucet is little too large and kind of distracting, but it''s still a good entry.', '2012-10-03 11:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6874449, 1034520, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another. <br/>It''s a good shot with a good message. I''m always struggling to find lights which are energy saving, but also give off good light all the time. Now that they make LED light bulbs, instead of these crappy candlelit ones, I might have to upgrade.</td>', '#3, tied with another. It''s a good shot with a good message. I''m always struggling to find lights which are energy saving, but also give off good light all the time. Now that they make LED light bulbs, instead of these crappy candlelit ones, I might have to upgrade.', '2012-10-03 11:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6874452, 1035273, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another.<br/>Isn''t it everyone''s life? At least that''s how I feel since I left school and got a career. It really does seem like there''s a candle burning at both ends all the time. Kids don''t help in this regard.</td>', '#3, tied with another.Isn''t it everyone''s life? At least that''s how I feel since I left school and got a career. It really does seem like there''s a candle burning at both ends all the time. Kids don''t help in this regard.', '2012-10-03 11:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
