(6876267, 1035209, 124815, '<td valign="top">The pathos! I can hear the music! Totally adorable.<br/>The edited version is trying to say too much and takes away the candor sliding the image into illustration mode (that you always prefer).<br/>The dancing light above their "heads" is so delicate and still subordinate to the action making the photo to look so real!<br/>Wonderful playing of the matches in their attempt to dance also.<br/></td>', 'The pathos! I can hear the music! Totally adorable.The edited version is trying to say too much and takes away the candor sliding the image into illustration mode (that you always prefer).The dancing light above their "heads" is so delicate and still subordinate to the action making the photo to look so real!Wonderful playing of the matches in their attempt to dance also.', '2012-10-05 08:27:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6876325, 1035209, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great set up Christophe- your passion to get the shot you want is indefatigable!</td>', 'Great set up Christophe- your passion to get the shot you want is indefatigable!', '2012-10-05 09:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6876338, 1035213, 12611, '<td valign="top">The details are perfect. The candle is as illuminating as a quiet moment of denouement- and as such the candle must be bright. Great shot Brennan, and congrats!</td>', 'The details are perfect. The candle is as illuminating as a quiet moment of denouement- and as such the candle must be bright. Great shot Brennan, and congrats!', '2012-10-05 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6876346, 1035183, 12611, '<td valign="top">I too, cannot look at this shot without wincing a bit- the fire, the hair, the wax... However, your composition is terrific, and you have achieved a truly pleasing glow with the choice of black and white.</td>', 'I too, cannot look at this shot without wincing a bit- the fire, the hair, the wax... However, your composition is terrific, and you have achieved a truly pleasing glow with the choice of black and white.', '2012-10-05 09:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6876347, 1035049, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent set-up- I saw the Frankenstein monster shadow!</td>', 'Excellent set-up- I saw the Frankenstein monster shadow!', '2012-10-05 09:53:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6876351, 1035234, 12611, '<td valign="top">The eyes are nice behind the mask;<br/>I like this shot and understand it to be a psychological thriller of a shot- a chance for the viewer to imagine the tragic circumstances of tale. Perhaps for some, the Halloween movie style mask does conjure slasher rather than psychological horror- and that would be a shame to pigeonhole a shot like this in that way.</td>', 'The eyes are nice behind the mask;I like this shot and understand it to be a psychological thriller of a shot- a chance for the viewer to imagine the tragic circumstances of tale. Perhaps for some, the Halloween movie style mask does conjure slasher rather than psychological horror- and that would be a shame to pigeonhole a shot like this in that way.', '2012-10-05 09:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6876361, 1035209, 144365, '<td valign="top">I would have ranked your edited version much lower because the trailing flames look ridiculous in my opinion. <br/> <br/>But then again, you do this to please yourself, not me.</td>', 'I would have ranked your edited version much lower because the trailing flames look ridiculous in my opinion.  But then again, you do this to please yourself, not me.', '2012-10-05 10:17:36.000000', NULL, 0),
